### Test the JWT API (open this file in Rider / Visual Studio / VS Code with the REST Client extension)
### Run the app with the "https" profile first.

@host = https://localhost:7166

### 1. Log in as a local (MySQL) user -> copy the "token" from the response
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Call a protected endpoint with that token (paste it after "Bearer ")
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
